        {
          "id": "changelog:railways@1.6.7+forge-mc1.20.1",
          "citacao": "Ported to Create 6.0. Fixed NoSuchMethodError crash in MixinCarriageContraptionEntity when trains tick with Create 6. Requires Create 6.0.0 or newer."
